==Battleground==
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.
*15 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*6 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 16 seconds<sup>480f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Angelic Sleipnir]]s spawn after 25.33 seconds<sup>760f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
*10 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Angelic Sleipnirs are the only dangerous enemies here, use high-range attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to deal with them. You can stall the frontlines with [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] while you stack up Dragons and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cats]]. Once both Sleipnirs fall, the stage is essentially beaten.

==Trivia==
*The acronym, DDoS, stands for ''Distributed Denial-of-Service''.

